<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Ephesus-te</book>
  <para style="h">Ephesus-te</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ephesus-te</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesus-te</para>
  <para style="mt">Ephesus-te</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ deina ziehin Khris Jesu’ sawltahpi Paul in, Ephesus khuo-a om misiengthote, Khris Jesu sunga mi muonhuoite tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung pan hepina le kilemna om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khris sungah vantung munte sunga om hlagau thupha namcin tawh eite thupha ei pie, i Topa Jesu Khris’ Pa Pasien in thupha nga ta hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />eite in ama mai-ah itna hang tawh siengtho-in paubanna i nei lo nadingin leitung pien masangin ama in Khris sungah ei teel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’ hoisah le ama’ dei dan tawh kizui-in ama in Jesu Khris tungtawnin ama’ tate ahi dinga tapa za nga dingin ei na laitan kholsa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua khu a Itpa sungah eite ei hlawnpieh ahi, a minthang ama’ hepina i patawi thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eite in ama’ sisan tungtawnin ama sungah tatkhietna i nga vua, ama’ hepina zieha haunate tawh kizui-in i thupalsatnate uh tungah ngaidamna i nga vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama in pilna namcin le thuthuh theina tawh eite tungah a dimlet a ei pieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Khris sunga a koisa ama’ hoisah dan tawh kizui-in ama’ deina thuthuhpi zong ei theisah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua thuthuhpi i ci pen in, a hun a cin ciengin vantung le leitunga a om sil bangkim Khris sunga gawmtuo ding gelna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ngaisutna le a deina tawh kituoha sil bangkim a muolsuo pa in ama’ ngimna tawh kituohin a laitansa bangin kote in zong Khris sungah gouluo za ka nga vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khris tungah lametna a koi masa kote a minthanna a patawi dinga ka nuntat thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in ang kihutdamna lungdamna thu ahi thuman thutah za-in ama na up zaw ciengun, nohaw zong ama sungah kamciemna tawh kipawl Hlagau Siengtho tawh ang kiciemtesa na hi ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua khu ama’ minthanna patawi nadingin Pasien neisa mite’ tatkhietna dongin i luo ding ei khamkholna gou ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in Topa Jesu sunga na upna ule misiengthote zosie tunga na itna uh ka na za zo ta a, tua thu ziehin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ka thungetnate-ah hing phawh kawmin note adingin khawl hun nei loin lungdam ka ko den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note in ama na thei ziehun i Topa Jesu Khris Pasien, a minthang Pa in note lungpilna le kilahna ang pieh thei nading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na lungsim mitte uh vahsahin note ang hlatna tawh kipawl lametna, misiengthote lahah a minthang ama’ gouluo zieha haunate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />le a lien ama’ vanglietna nasep thupite dung zui-in a um eite adingin tezawh ahi lo ama’ vanglietna lienpite bang ahei ci note in na thei nadingun thu kang ngetpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasien in sina panin ama thosahin, vantung munte sunga ama’ zietlamah a tosah lai-in Khris sungah na sem dingin tami vanglietna guonpieh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />vaihawmna le thuneina, vanglietna le uhna vannuoite tungah hile, tu khanghun beh ah hi loin, ang tung ding khanghun ah zong hile a kiphuo min zosie tungah a tosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasien in ama’ keng nei-ah sil bangkim koi a, a hlattuom pawlpi adingin a lutangin ama a bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hlattuom pawlpi pen ama’ pumpi ahi a, bangkimah bangkim a kicingsah pa’ kicinna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note na hi ule khielnate le mawnate ziehin na si vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tami leitung tawndante, tulaitaha thumang lote lahah na a sem hlagau ahi hui lah a uh pa’ deina bangin zui-in tuate sungah na tuolbuol ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eihaw zosie in i lungsim le i pumpi’ lunggulnate zui-in amate lahah cilesa deinate sungah i na nungta ngai vua, i pienpi ngainate ziehin eite zong midangte bangin thangpaina’ tate i na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuotuona a hau Pasien in a lien mama eite ei itna ziehin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />i khielnate tungtawnin si-a i op laitah nangawnun Khris tawh ei hingtonsah a, hepina ziehin hutdamin i om ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien in Khris tawh eite ei thotonsah a, vantung munte-a om Khris Jesu sungah ama tawh ei totonsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua khu ang tung ding khang hunah Khris Jesu sunga a om tezawh lo ama’ hepina ziehin eite tungah ama’ migitna ei lah thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen hepina ziehin upna tawh hutdamsa na hi ta vua, tua khu noma’ sepna zieh ahi vawt sih hi; Pasien’ letsong ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nasep zieh ahi lo ziehin koima in a kisahtheipi thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite pen nasep hoite a sem dinga Khris Jesu sunga ei kipiengsah ama’ bawlsate i hi vua, tua khu Pasien in a na gelkholsa i nuntahzie ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin nidang lai-in pienpi Gentile-te na hi vua, “tep kitante ka hi uhi,” a kici mite in- cilesa tungah mihing’ khut tawh tahsa teptanna- a tep kitan lo mite ang ci uh phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hun lai-in Khris nei loin Israel innkuon belpawl panin ang kipuse-in kamciem tawh a kipawl thuciemnate a nga lo gamdang mite na hi vua, leitungah lametna nei lo le Pasien nei lote na hi lam uh phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Khris’ sisan ziehin hun khat lai-a gamlapi-a om note, tu-in ama in Khris Jesu sungah ang kinaisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen ama eite’ kilemna ahi hi; ama in ama’ cilesa ah eite kikala a om huotna a kici dalna kulpi cimsahin pawl nite pawlkhat a suohsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in amama’ sungah tua minam nite munah minam tha khat a siem thei nadingin, thukham’ thupiehte, le tawndan ngainate phietmangin kilemna bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />singlamte tungtawnin Pasien tungah pawl nite pumkhat a suoh dingin ei lemtuo kia-in, tua tungtawnin ama in kigalbawlnate a sisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama pei-in a gamlapi-a om note le a nai-a om mite kungah kilemna thu a gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ei minam nite in ama tungtawnin Hlagau khat sungah Pa kung lut theina thu i nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n note pen khuolmi le gamdang mite hi nawn loin misiengthote tawh gammi suohtonin Pasien’ innkuon sung mite zong na hi ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />innkiu suongpi Jesu Khris mama tawh khuombul ahi sawltahpite le kamsangte tunga a kilam na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama sungah tua inn buppi kizom dimdiemin khang a, tuaci’n Topa sungah a siengtho biehinnpi khat a suoh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />note zong Pasien a Hlagau-a ang tenna mun a suoh dingin a kilamton na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin no Gentile-te tangin Khris Jesu adinga thongkie pa keima Paul in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />note adingin Pasien’ hepina nasep kei tunga ei kipiehna le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />lai tawh a tomno-a kang giel bangin keima tungah kilahna tawh tua thuthuh bangci bangin ei kitheisah ahei, ci thu na za zo tham ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami lai na sim ciengun Khris’ thuthuh ka theitel zie na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhun ciengin a siengtho ama’ sawltahpite le a kamsangte tungah tami thuthuh a kitheisah bangin nidang khang hunin mihingte tungah na kitheisah kha lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua thuthuh i ci in: Lungdamna thu tungtawnin Gentile-te in Israel-te tawh gou luo tonin, pumpi khat’ nate suoh tonin Khris Jesu sungah kamciem a nga tonte ahi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima tunga ei kipie Pasien’ hepina letsong tawh kizui-in ama’ vanglietna nasepna hang tawh kei zong tami lungdamna thu’ nasempa khat a suoh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei ka hile misiengtho zosiete lahah a neupen ka hi vangin Gentile-te tungah ciengtan a nei lo Khris’ haunate ahi lungdamna thute a puoh ding le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />sil bangkim a piengsah pa Pasien sungah tangtawng peh pana a na kiphuoldap ahi tua thuthuh tawh kisai gelna pen bang ahei, ci mi zosie a musah dingin tami hepina ei kipie zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua khu tuhun hlattuom pawlpi tungtawnin vantung munte-a om thuneite le uhna a neite tungah a kicing Pasien’ pilna namcin a kitheisah nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami pen kumtawn ama’ tupna dung zui-in ama in i Topa Jesu Khris sunga a sepsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eite in ama i upna uh tungtawnin ama sunga a om hangsanna le muonna tawh Pasien kung i lut thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note adinga ka thuohnate uh ziehin keima in na lungkieh lo nadingun thu kang ngetpieh hi; tuate pen note’ minthanna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin ka Pa mai-ah ka khupdin a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ama tung panin vantung le leitunga innkuon zosie a min kivaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a minthang a haunate dung zui-in ama’ Hlagau vanglietna tawh na sunglam mi uh ang thakhausah nading le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />upna tungtawnin note’ lungsim sungah Khris ang tengin itna sungah na kiphungvua thei nadingun thu kang ngetpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note in zong misiengthote zosie tawh Khris’ ei itna adung avai, a sanna le a thuhnate na thei nadingun vanglietna nei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien’ bukimna namcin tawh kidim a, theina in a bat zawh lo Khris’ itna na thei nadingun thu kang ngetpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in i nget thei zosie le i lunggel thei zosie sanga a nah thupi zawtham le, eite sungah a vanglietna tawh kizui-a a sem thei pa tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />khang zosie tungah hlattuom pawlpi sung le Khris Jesu sunga a om minthanna kumtawnin hing om zing taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa sunga thongkie pa keima Paul in ang kihlatna utawh kituohin hinkhuo na nei thei nadingun kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sil bangkimah kiniemkhiehna, lungnemna, lungduoina tawh kidimin, itna sungah khatlekhat na kithuohpi ciet unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />note ang khiton kilemna sungah Hlagau kipumkhatna na tuhkip thei nadingun na hi thei tawpun na bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note ang kihlatna ah lametna khat sunga ang kihlan ahi ma bangin pumpi khat le Hlagau khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa khat, upna khat, baptize-na khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na zosie tunga om, na zosie tungtawna na zosie sunga a om pa, mi zosie’ Pa le Pasien khat beh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Khris’ letsong ei kipiehna zaza tawh kituohin eite khat ciet tungah hepina ei kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, “Ama a sangna-ah a kato ciengin a kimansa salte zawpito a, ama in mite tungah letsongte a pie hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(“Ama kato hi,” a ci ciengin bang deina ahei cile ama zong lei sungtawng tengah na kumsuh zo hi, a cinopna hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sil bangkim a kicinsah thei nadingin a kumsuh pa pen vantungte zosie sanga a sangzaw-a kato pa ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama’ pieh letsongte ahile pawlkhat sawltahpite, pawlkhat kamsangte, pawlkhat lungdamna thu gente, pawlkhat pawlpi kem siete le laihil siete hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amate in Khris’ pumpi a kilam nadingin Pasien’ na a sem ding misiengthote pantah ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua khu upna le Pasien’ Tapa theitheina-ah eihaw zosie pumkhat suohin picing a, a bukim Khris’ cingtahna zaza cieng dong i tun thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eite i hi ule mihingte’ ngiensiemna le a pilkhel a zuouthu gelna uh ahi thuhilna hui namcin in ei mutna zieha a hawisuh a hawito kawikawi naupangte i hi nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lutang ahi Khris sungah i khanto bukim thei nadingun itna tawh thuman thutah i genzaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama tung panin pumpi buppi tawh thahui thazam zosie kizomin kiphan dimdiem a, pumpi nate in a sep ding ciet uh hoitahin a sep ciengun itna sungah tua pumpi khangin ama le ama a kilamkip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in keima in tami thu sukipin Topa sunga kang paugen ahi hi: Kimanna a nei lo amau’ lungsim bangin Gentile-te a nuntah bangun note nungta nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lungkhauna zieh ule a lungmawlnate ziehun a thu theinate uh suhmielin a om ta a, tuaci’n Pasien’ hinna panin a kikhenkhie ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in maizumna mel thei nawn loin thangtatna lamah a kipumpieh sieng vua, a siengtho lo sil bangkim a sem dingin lunggulna a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khris’ thu na sin uh pen tua bang ahi sih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Jesu sungah thuman thutah a op bangin note in ama’ thu na za zo tahpi vua, ama sungah thu ang kihil zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nidang lai-a na hindan lui uh ahi cilesa lunggulna’ solna zieha a muot thei na milui uh a paimang ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />na lungsim puohziete uh a kibawltha ding le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />dihna le siengthona tahtah sungah Pasien tawh a kisun dinga ang kisiemsa na hina uh dung zui-in, mitha na sil nadingun thu ang kihil ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin eite khatlekhat pumpi nate i hi ciet ziehun zuouthu gennate paimangin i unpi-un i vengte kungah thuman thutah gen ciet vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungthah unlen ahi vangin maw sih un; lungthahna tawh ni na tumsah sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />dawimangpa mun na pie sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gutate in gu nawn loin, tasamte bang khatpo a hopsawn thei nadingun a khut utawh thuman tahin gimpipi-in na semzaw uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na kamham un a za mite phattuomna a pieh thei nadingin, na kam sung panun kam gilo pusuohsah sih unlen, kisapna a om bangin mite kilamkip nadingin a kimang thei kamte beh na hamzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tatna ni adinga ang kiciemtena uh Pasien’ Hlagau Siengtho na dasah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Note kung panin kilunghimawna, thangpaina, lungthahna, kihau kiselna, le kigensietna zosie, thangsietnate zosie tawh na paimangtha un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khatlekhat kihepi-in lainatna na kinei unlen, Pasien in Khris sungah note’ mawna ang maisah bangin note zong khatlekhat na kimaisah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ang ki-it tate na hi ziehun Pasien a ette mite na hi unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khris in eite ei itin, eite adingin Pasien tungah a namtui silpieh le biehpiehna dingin ama le ama a kipieh bangin itna sungah na nungta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle misiengthote lahah a om dinga a kilawm lo ahi bang ma-in note lahah numei-pasal pahtatna, sil sieng lo nam khat popo le huoihamna kicite nangawn genin kinei vet sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kam panun zummaw hamna, mot-hamna, a thanghuoi ciemmuina cite na omsah sih un; tua bang sangin lungdamkona na neizaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numei-pasal khielna a bawl mi, a siengtho lo mi, le a huoiham mi in (milim bie pa a cinopna) Khris le Pasien’ gamah gouluo bangma a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tam thute ziehin mi thunung lote tungah Pasien’ thangpaina tung ding ahi ziehin, koima in thugina lote tawh kisolsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate tawh kigop sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen nidang lai-in note khuomiel sungah na om vua, ahi vangin tu-in ahile Topa sungah khuovah na hi ta uhi. Khuovah’ tate bangin na nungta un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />azieh pen a hoi, a dih, le a man sil bangkimah khuovah’ ga kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa’ lungkimna bang ahei, ci na mu nadingun na hakat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ga nei lo khuomiel nasepnate ah kihal loin tuate na pholah zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua bang mite in guhsima a septe uh gen ding nangawnin zumhuoi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hizongle khuovah in a pholah sil zosie mu thei a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen tua a kimu thei sil zosie khuovah ahi hi. Tua ahi ziehin, “A kimu mi aw, khanglo in! Sina panin tho in, tua hile nangma tungah Khris in ang tanvah ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pil lote bang hi loin, a pilte bangin na nuntah ziete uh kidawm unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hun le nite a siet tah ziehin na hun neisunte uh a hoi lamin zang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n mawlawm sih unlen, Topa’ deina bang ahei, ci theisiemzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zu in mi siesah thei ahi ziehin zu kham sih unlen, Hlagau tawh kidimzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note lahah phatna late, biehna late, le hlagau lam late na sah ciengun, na lung sung vuah kihuol tahin Topa tungah na sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I Topa Jesu Khris’ minin sil bangkim adingin Pa Pasien tungah nuomthu tut zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khris zatahna zalin khatlekhat thu na kimang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zite aw, Topa’ thu na man bangun na pasalte’ thu na mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen Khris in hlattuom pawlpi’ lutang ahi ma bangin pasal in a zi’ lutang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpi in Khris’ thu a man bangin zite in zong sil bangkimah a pasalte’ thu a man ding uh kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasalte aw, Khris in hlattuom pawlpi itin ama adingin ama ma a kipieh bangin na zite na it un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in hlattuom pawlpi a sienthosah thei nadingin thu tungtawnin tui tawh sawp sieng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua in hlattuom pawlpi pen a nieh, a vuntun le tua bang nam khatpopo om loin, ama ma tungah a siengtho le kawbang loin etlawm taha a kipieh thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ma bangin pasalte in a pumpi uh a it bangun a zite a it ding uh kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile ama’ pumpi a muda koima a om ngai sih a, Khris in a hlattuom pawlpi va-in a kep bangin ama’ pumpi va-in kemzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen eite ama’ pumpi nate i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tami thu ziehin pasal in a nu le a pa nuasie-in a zi tawh kigawm ding a, tua nite sa khat a suoh ding uhi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tami pen thuthuhpi khat hi a, Khris le hlattuom pawlpite tunga a zang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin note a koi mapo in ama le ama a ki-it bangin na zite uh na it ding uh kilawm hi. Zi in zong a pasal a zatah ding kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tate aw, Topa sungah na nu na pate uh na it un, azieh pen tami khu thudih ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nu le na pa zatah in,” tami in kamciem tawh kikop thupieh masa pen ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tuaci’n leitungah note nuomsa-in na dam sawt ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pate aw, na tate lungthahsah sih unlen, pattahna le Topa lamlahna ah khangliensah zaw un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silate aw, note in Khris’ thu na man bangun zauna le linna tawh lung khat khai-in na leitung pute uh’ thu na mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate ang mu sungin a lungkim nading beh uh hi loin, Khris’ silate bangin na lungtang sung vuah Pasien’ deina bangin na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Numei le pasalte’ na a sem bang hi loin Topa’ na a sem bangin thanopna tawh na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Silate i hi a, sila lote i hi zongin, Topa kung panin na hoi i sep poma a kibangin i ngakia ding uhi, ci i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pute aw, amate tungah tua bang ma-in na bawl un. No gel pen vantungah na ni-un pu kibang nei na hi vua, ama in deidan a nei lo lam thei unlen, na silate na hugih nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tawpna-ah Topa sung le ama’ vangliet thahatna sungah thakhauh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dawimangpa’ solna na nan zawh nadingun Pasien’ galvan bukim tawh kivon un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite do pen tahsa le sisan nei galte hi loin, uhna neite, thuneinate, tu hun tami leitung khuomiel vanglietnate, le vantung munte a om hlagau gilo galkapte ahi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin sietna ni ang tun ciengin na nan zawh nading ule sil bangkim na sep zaw ciengun na dinkip zawh nadingun Pasien’ galvan bukim keng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na kawng vuah thutah kawnggah gah unlen, dihna awmdal tawh kivonin ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kedap bangin na keng vuah kilemna lungdamna thu bulin a baisa-in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gilopa’ meikuong thaltangte na suhmit zawh nadingun tam teng zosie tawh upna lum na tawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hutdamna sia lukhu le Pasien’ kammal ahi Hlagau namsau tawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hun zosie-ah Hlagau Siengtho tawh thungetna namcin le thumna namcin na nei un. Tua banga na bawl thei nadingun pilvang unlen, misiengthote zosie adingin thu na ngetpieh zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thu gen ciengin ka gen ding thu ei kipieh nading le lungdamna thuthuh hangtaha ka theisah thei nadingin kei adingin zong thu ei na ngetpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei ka hile tua thu ziehin kol kibul palai khat ka hi hi. Ka gen ding bangin hangsan taha ka gen thei nadingin thu ei na ngetpieh bo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note in zong kei bangci op a, bang sem ka hei, ci thu nei thei nadingun Tychicus in na kung vuah thu zosie ang gen ding hi. Ama pen Topa sungah nasem muonhuoi ka it sanggam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kote bangci op ci note in na thei nading ule na lungsimte uh ang hansuo thei nading mama tupna tawh na kung vuah ama kang sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi buppi tungah Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung panin upna tawh kipawl itna le kilemna hing tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tul thei lo itna tawh i Topa Jesu Khris a it mi zosie tungah zong hepina om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
